<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said on Monday it had cut its rating for Mexico's Apasco SA de CV to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Carmen Slade wrote in a report that Apasco &quot;should report sequentially flat or slightly lower cement volumes in the third quarter.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company is 18 percent from Salomon's target price and will see lower operating margins through 1998.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 52.50 on the Mexican bourse on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
